<title>BELGIUM: EU SET TO BAN BLOKKER'S TOYS &quot;R&quot; US DUTCH BUY.</title>
<headline>EU SET TO BAN BLOKKER'S TOYS &quot;R&quot; US DUTCH BUY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission's competition service has proposed blocking the acquisition by Dutch retailer Blokker of Toys &quot;R&quot; Us' Netherlands' operations, suggesting instead that it take control of only part of it, EU sources said on Monday.</p>
</text>
